.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu prime\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-section\fR] [\fB\-\-brief\fR] [\fB\-\-static\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
